      "name": "Status Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "status-chip",
      "description": "A labeled result status, never color alone.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip\">Đạt</span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-block;background:var(--success-subtle, #edf5ef);color:var(--success-text, #235d42);border-radius:5px;padding:4px 8px;font:600 .8125rem var(--font-family, 'Source Sans 3', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif);white-space:nowrap}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Record Sheet",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Flat record container with a quiet divided heading.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-card\"><header class=\"ds-card-head\"><h2>Kết quả học phần</h2></header><div class=\"ds-card-body\">Chọn học kỳ để xem kết quả.</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-card{background:var(--card-bg, #fff);color:var(--text-main, #292f35);border:1px solid var(--border-color, #dce2e5);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:none;font:400 1rem/1.5 var(--font-family, 'Source Sans 3', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif)}.ds-card-head{padding:22px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color, #dce2e5)}.ds-card-head h2{margin:0;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.25}.ds-card-body{padding:18px 24px;color:var(--text-muted, #5d6871);font-size:.9375rem}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Record Actions",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "record-actions",
      "description": "Native automatic popover for named existing row actions; production wrapper positions it and focuses the first available action.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-action-trigger\" popovertarget=\"ds-record-actions\" aria-label=\"Thao tác cho hồ sơ mẫu\">Thao tác <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path d=\"m4 6 4 4 4-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></button><div id=\"ds-record-actions\" popover=\"auto\" class=\"ds-action-menu\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Thao tác cho hồ sơ mẫu\"><p>Hồ sơ mẫu</p><button type=\"button\" popovertarget=\"ds-record-actions\" popovertargetaction=\"hide\">Xem hồ sơ</button><button type=\"button\" popovertarget=\"ds-record-actions\" popovertargetaction=\"hide\">Chỉnh sửa</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-action-trigger{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:40px;padding:6px 11px;border:1px solid #c4cdd3;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:var(--text-muted,#5d6871);font:600 .8125rem/1.5 var(--font-family,\"Source Sans 3\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);cursor:pointer}.ds-action-trigger:hover{background:#edf0f2;color:var(--text-main,#292f35)}.ds-action-trigger:active{background:#edf0f2}.ds-action-menu{width:260px;max-height:calc(100dvh - 32px);overflow:auto;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--border-color,#dce2e5);border-radius:12px;background:var(--card-bg,#fff);color:var(--text-main,#292f35);font:400 .875rem/1.5 var(--font-family,\"Source Sans 3\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif)}.ds-action-menu p{padding:7px 6px 12px;margin:0 0 5px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color,#dce2e5);font-weight:600}.ds-action-menu button{display:block;width:100%;min-height:44px;padding:11px 10px;margin:2px 0;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:inherit;font:600 .875rem/1.4 var(--font-family,\"Source Sans 3\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-action-menu button:hover,.ds-action-menu button:active{background:var(--primary-subtle,#eaf3f5)}.ds-action-trigger:focus-visible,.ds-action-menu button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--primary,#247d8b);outline-offset:3px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Sổ học vụ số",
    "overview": "Sổ học vụ số is a quiet digital academic ledger within the user-selected Academic Focus palette. White ruled sheets, graphite task indexes and restrained petrol actions make records and their next action readable across all three roles.\n\nThe interface uses one local sans family, tabular figures, explicit labels and compact controls. Thin dividers and pale grounds supply structure; protected editors and profiles open at the right edge. Vietnamese content, complete academic facts and keyboard access remain part of the visual system. Each task receives its own composition, recorded in the surface briefs.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "White ruled records and graphite task indexes within Academic Focus.",
      "Readable tabular numbers, labeled scope and explicit semantic states.",
      "Flat bordered sheets, compact controls and protected side editors.",
      "Mobile selectors and agendas, contained detailed records and reduced-motion support."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Purposeful Color Rule",
        "body": "Use petrol for actions and the current choice; use success, warning and danger only to communicate a labeled state.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Comparable Numbers Rule",
        "body": "Use tabular numerals for grades, credits and summary metrics so adjacent values remain easy to compare.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Surface Rule",
        "body": "Ordinary cards remain shadowless. Reserve elevation for modal dialogs and transient feedback.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the shared local font and tabular figures for academic numbers.",
      "Do pair semantic color with a visible status label.",
      "Do retain labeled fields, visible keyboard focus and mobile action heights of at least 40px.",
      "Do contain wide tables in horizontal scroll regions and retain complete record values."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't replace the Academic Focus palette with decorative gradients or unrelated accents.",
      "Don't add shadows to ordinary cards or turn records into ornamental hero panels.",
      "Don't encode academic status solely through color.",
      "Don't conceal record columns to make the page fit a small screen.",
      "Don't impose one overview or card composition on every academic task."
    ]
  }
}
